    "## Social Media Integration Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "**What we did:**\n",
    "1. Created sample diabetes-related social media posts\n",
    "2. Preprocessed text (cleaning, tokenization, stopword removal)\n",
    "3. Performed sentiment analysis (positive/negative/neutral)\n",
    "4. Analyzed word frequencies\n",
    "5. Identified health-related themes\n",
    "6. Examined sentiment by theme\n",
    "7. Integrated social insights with clinical findings\n",
    "\n",
